# Thinking pixels: a block field next to a few pieces
sim 512 256 scene calm seed 7
box source "Emitter" at 200 120 states off|on|storm
slider rain "Rain" at 200 320 states dry|drizzle|pour
bar fill "Fill level" at 520 320 values 10|40|80
note n "Paint sand and water in the TUI (s to switch view).\nThe field runs in lockstep on every client." at 800 160
link rain -> fill
step "Quiet field" source=off
step "Turn the emitter on" source=on rain=drizzle
step "Storm" source=storm rain=pour
